-- usage_events is shared. task_usage never reached this decision at all: it
-- was removed outright in an earlier, unrelated change (table, model and MCP
-- tool all deleted 2026-05-20), so there was nothing left to migrate for it.
--
-- Resolved 2026-09-27 (a weed pass during task #4971): `poll_owners`,
-- `settings`, `filter_presets`, `learnings`, `learning_retrievals` and
-- `usage_events` had each joined `SharedTable` in `src/spacetime/snapshot.rs`
-- over several earlier phases without this spec's own `enum SharedTable` or
-- `shared_table_count` being updated to match — left as found at the time,
-- since reconciling it was a dedicated weed pass rather than a side effect of
-- whichever table prompted the note. Task #4971 added a seventh,
-- `retired_feed_items`, which is what that pass was for; `enum SharedTable`
-- and `shared_table_count` above now list all seventeen and are back in sync
